    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "直接判断：募资专员把组织目标和资金需求转成可核实的支持请求，并维护从首次接触、承诺到致谢的记录。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "适合信号：能准确说明用途、接受拒绝，并对承诺、限制和下一步留下清楚记录。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "谨慎条件：若容易为达目标夸大效果、替组织承诺税务或回报，应先练习边界和升级。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全试做只使用四条虚构记录，不联系真人、不收款、不使用真实个人信息。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.profile",
      "id": "profile",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "身份：本页对应O*NET 13-1131.00，覆盖为组织策划募资活动、征集金钱或其他捐赠，并可制作宣传材料和说明组织需求。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.definition-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "输入：经批准的组织使命、项目说明、资金用途、潜在支持者清单、渠道规则、历史联系和数据字段。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.responsibilities-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "任务：研究潜在支持者、建立关系、准备请求、执行活动、记录回应和承诺，并向支持者致谢。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.responsibilities-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "产出：活动简报、分群依据、沟通版本、承诺与限制记录、致谢、进度与成本复盘。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.responsibilities-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "关键判断：请求是否适配对方、用途与限制是否说清、何时停止联系、何时将资格、税务、隐私或利益冲突问题升级。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.work-context-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "流程：核批准版本与资格边界，研究支持者，形成请求，复核并发送，记录回应与限制，完成致谢和复盘。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.work-context-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.onet-structured-fields-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "工具：捐赠人数据库、邮件与活动平台、项目说明、预算表、审批记录和版本受控模板。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.onet-structured-fields-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "协作：与项目负责人、财务、法务或合规、传播、活动执行和数据权限负责人协作。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.career-quick-answers-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "质量：对象、渠道、版本、承诺、限制、金额状态、同意与下一步可追溯；拒绝和未知不被改写。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.career-quick-answers-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "边界：本岗位执行关系与活动，不自动拥有组织公开募捐资格，不替财务确认到账，也不即兴提供税务保证。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.profile.definition-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
