    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.ai-impact",
      "id": "ai-impact",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "AI可辅助整理公开资料、形成沟通草稿和检查字段缺失，但不能证明捐赠意愿或组织资格。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "采用前要限定批准语料、数据权限、发送权限、人工复核和撤回流程。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "潜在支持者资料可能含个人信息，输入范围、访问权限、保存期限与删除规则必须明确。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "人类复核组织名称、项目用途、请求金额、回报、限制、称谓、渠道和历史联系。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "最终发送、资格判断、税务陈述、利益冲突处理和捐赠限制解释由有权人员决定。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "错误画像、虚构个性化、遗漏拒绝或重复联系会损害信任并制造合规风险。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.6",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "任务暴露、工具采用、生产率和净就业变化是不同问题，不能从生成草稿推导岗位消失。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.7",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "先在虚构数据和不发送的草稿环节试用，记录错误后再决定是否扩大。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "fundraisers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.8",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
